# TypeScript incremental build state.
# nest-cli's deleteOutDir removes dist/ but NOT this file, which lives at the
# package root. A stale one convinces tsc that everything is up to date, so
# `rm -rf dist && npm run build` succeeds and emits nothing at all.
*.tsbuildinfo
